  "description": "Your BokehTi SRAM\n\nTHE LATEST EVOLUTION OF OUR UNIQUE MASON BOKEH Ti, WITH CONFIGURABLE SRAM BUILD OPTIONS AND CUSTOMISABLE FEATURES\n\nThe Bokeh Ti offers a world-leading finely detailed titanium frameset, welded and finished by a long-established, highly experienced maker in Tuscany, Italy. Features like 3D-printed titanium UDH dropouts make this one of the most exclusive and advanced titanium frames available. The Bokeh Ti is welded in small batches and is available on a pre-order basis only.\n\nThe Bokeh Ti takes all the characteristics of our hugely popular award-winning aluminium Bokeh and adds the incredibly taut, propulsive titanium ride that is made possible by a full custom Italian tubeset made just for us by Dedacciai. This is our ultimate smooth, comfortable, fast, multi-terrain, continent-crossing, ultra endurance machine.\n\nFor the latest version of the Bokeh Ti, we have chosen to keep all the bike's character and capability, whilst enhancing its smooth, fast, ground covering nature. Updated with T47, internal routing through the bottom bracket and cleanly out through the chain stays, along with dedicated dynamo routing through the top tube, the routing is now very clean and practical.\n\nThis bicycle is designed for an engaging, spirited, and dynamic ride across a hugely varied spectrum of surfaces and terrain.\n\nAll builds available for our Bokeh and Exposure models are also available for the Bokeh Ti. Ask us to help you configure your dream specification.\n\nMASON CUSTOM PROGRAMME\n\nWe love building individual bicycles for individual people. All MASON models are open to and carefully designed build levels.\n\nWhile your frame is being welded and carefully finished you also have the chance to specify a full ‘Mason Custom Build’, basing your finished bicycle on a choice of components from our various carefully chosen suppliers. Please contact us for further information on this process and to start your dream build.\n\nAvailable with a choice of finishing kit from Deda and Ritchey\n\nAvailable with a choice of the best 650B and 700C tyres from Panaracer, WTB, Rene Herse and Schwalbe.\n\nThis bike can be fitted with the Mason Luminance Upgrade. The ultimate dynamo + lighting set-up for all-terrain and multi-surface adventures. See 'Accessories + Upgrades' for details.\n\nAvailable with a choice of HUNT, DT Swiss and Campagnolo wheelsets in 700c or 650b. Other options available on request.\n\nFull set of high-grade, stainless steel accessory mounting screws and small parts, including cable routing parts and MASON Multiport inserts, supplied with frameset.\n\nSelect From: SRAM Rival AXS / Force AXS / Red AXS, including 1x XPLR gearing options.\n\nMASON Penta carbon microadjust seatpost and MASON Macro seatclamp included (MASON Sensor titanium post available as upgrade)",
